        "Id": "2e631e18-9532-44ee-8733-70200bde9af5",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Welcome Back, Agent17 №3",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GREEDY_RACCOON",
        "PublicId": "124606817186",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Greedy/mission_raccoon/scene_raccoon_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ebd039a9-8327-436e-bbcb-738378b95430).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, Agent 17. During your stay in the USA, we have received several more contracts that we would like to assign to you. Today you are heading to New York, to the Milton‑Fitzpatrick bank. Recently, a robbery occurred there, organized by the bank’s owner. The client, the bank’s owner himself, has instructed us to eliminate all witnesses who might know anything about this staged robbery. Eliminate the head of security, the chief accountant, and the shift manager. Get ready, Agent 17.",
